      "source": "Set the week date year to the given value which must resolve to a weekday in range <code>0 - 9999</code>.\nCan be a simple value, <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>field reference</code></a> or <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>expression</code></a>.",
